    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Putin jigsaw is puzzle jigsaw game with puzzles and images from president Putin and his friends. This is a logical game in which the goal of the game is to rearrange the tiles to get the final picture. Puzzle game contains 67images and can you be the lawnmower genious and solve all jigsaw puzzles<br>Different sized jigsaws, so be the hero and solve all jigsaws and collect steam achievements</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features of the game:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- 7 jigsaws for now<br>- Steam achievements<br>- Different sized jigsaw images</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buttons:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mouse to move jigsaws<br>- R = Restart game<br>- Escape= quit game</p>",
